{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "9ef7e3bffc0d6f3e4b3ea4fb7e281cfafeb43f7c06f8e468833480b6b1c8c63a", "ja": "ふたつの星空", "zh": "两片星空", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f6aeec55ea47189133df46adf111842b69809a4c71c4156607c28d5ad5063a72", "ja": "いよいよイベント当日。本番前にプラネタリ\nウムの見学もして、準備は万端。客席には海\n美の姉や、美也のおじいちゃんもいる。輝く\n笑顔でステージに向かっていく4人に、成功\nを確信するプロデューサーだった。", "zh": "终于到了活动当天。在正式演出前还参观了天文馆，准备工作万无一失。观众席上还有海美的姐姐和美也的爷爷。制作人看着4人带着灿烂的笑容走向舞台，确信演出一定会成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "90f5ee5f1a601d9c4a089b92ca9c6f74fb326ce802067194e3d0f989fe76a144", "ja": "プラネタリウムイベント、当日……", "zh": "天文馆活动当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "54750e7865b5be99cd826055d751ec7f6f4e06e1b1c71dee66c086f643fc7b0f", "ja": "あっ、見つけましたよ～。オリオン座で\n一番明るい……あれがベテルギウスですね～。", "zh": "啊，找到了～。猎户座里\n最明亮的……那个就是参宿四呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "150aebf27389bfbefb6f5ad0cf6732f1207857550c35823b9be402d97b3c1d4c", "ja": "その隣には、プロキオンとシリウスが輝いていますね。\n見事な星空です……。", "zh": "在它旁边，南河三和天狼星也在闪耀呢。\n真是美丽的星空……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "c326f98b869ad37f9106c16b6c230550112483ed6fdfc6ec6b2f0c231a94d4ae", "ja": "{$P$}、見て見て！\nあれが冬の大三角！　見つけやすいでしょ！？", "zh": "{$P$}，快看快看！\n那就是冬季大三角！很容易找到吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "40ecd9924689fa172204e5640e6ed2103ea20b84278d07b75032e47078f8940c", "ja": "シリウスからリゲル、アルデバラン、カペラ、\nポルックスとたどると、冬のダイヤモンドなのです。", "zh": "从天狼星沿着参宿七、毕宿五、五车二、北河三一路找过去，就是冬季大钻石啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "bd525456dde7fc18fbe44a87129e2342eb876d546d671ddf441de10d18176285", "ja": "{$P$}さん、あのダイヤモンド、\n冬のまつりにぴったりなのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，那颗钻石，\n最适合冬天的茉莉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "dc644333498c22c39d22b70f05650cd919d5a03a40541f682d96ea17e9795593", "ja": "まつり、あのダイヤモンドがほしいのです。\n{$P$}さん、……ね？", "zh": "小祭想要那颗钻石。{$P$}先生，……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "aa1d0defbcaa924c30527510fa9f1dbb9a0cdfeca6980e1fd4c42a7794321454", "ja": "いや、さすがにあれは無理じゃないか？\n外気圏どころか、太陽系の外だし……。", "zh": "不行，那种东西果然还是办不到吧？\n别说是在外气层了，都已经在太阳系外了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6d5b1e4727032f23295eeb48863730bb275ed78dceae643e49f2149a1f6e3d01", "ja": "プラネタリウム見学も無事終わって……みんな、\n準備はバッチリだな？　いよいよ本番だぞ！", "zh": "天文馆参观也顺利结束了……大家，\n准备得很充分吧？终于要正式上场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "801286e8e9fde528e0119df68c5015469bd3395469a2bfcbe6796764af7aa8ba", "ja": "はい。お任せください、{$P$}。\n今日のステージ、必ずや成功させてみせましょう。", "zh": "好的，请交给我吧，{$P$}。\n今天的舞台，我们一定会让它成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "914b26b8ca95c5f7fb440da581f9a781eb4520d08627b5ad10010e7ceb4928fd", "ja": "家族を招待するのって、なんかドキドキするね！？\n初めてじゃないけど、緊張してきた～っ！", "zh": "招待家人来看，总觉得好让人心跳加速呢！？\n虽然不是第一次了，可还是紧张起来了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "a64e7e68cc318ec4a05270272305288f2be0ac19748771fc12a14ea164a547fd", "ja": "まつりも、ドキドキなのです。\n美也ちゃんも、今日はドキドキなのですよね？", "zh": "茉莉也是，心里扑通扑通的呢。\n美也今天也觉得紧张吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "5e44321312f042951bab8213eb8cd6b4f49a2f8d1d7955d1943bf0b5506163be", "ja": "はい～。今日は私も、\nおじいちゃんを招待したんですよ～。", "zh": "是呀～今天我也邀请爷爷来了哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "d2874ead7535974799da417948b53b2c1dcaeaaf6de420d566be07fb48f0b678", "ja": "ホント！？　美也のおじいちゃん、会いたい！\n美也に似てるのかな？", "zh": "真的！？我想见美也的爷爷！  \n不知道长得像不像美也呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "b7267e4d87ed59765d5b85d956861049028e34902c72611394ddb0750223427a", "ja": "眉毛の形が似てると、よく言われます～。\n確かめてみてください～。", "zh": "大家经常说，我爷爷的眉毛形状和我很像哦～  \n请你亲自确认一下吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "dff77287d7c54f87b1c4f20787cb10cd7c65c9a4faf063f1854ff00093d2db0d", "ja": "わかった！　眉毛に注目してみるよ！！", "zh": "知道了！我会注意眉毛的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "3b12d22927d02b1ee2a4692a76d7f4edfed23198a68d92457d74dc5fba3e3007", "ja": "{$P$}、不思議です。美也がいると、\n緊張がどこかに吹き飛んでしまうようです。", "zh": "{$P$}，真不可思议。只要美也在，紧张感好像就不知吹到哪里去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f0f2464fd10478fcae00bbd19109d3f06bbe8a91ab9ada0b8a3e7b564b68e862", "ja": "貴音、緊張してたのか？", "zh": "贵音，你之前紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1019_008tak", "source_sha256": "eb4610adeff82ed412015697c8387fab82d4b59d5ee4ce44930b085d324186b3", "ja": "はい、少しだけ……。ですが、もう大丈夫です。\n私には、心強い仲間達が一緒ですから。", "zh": "是的，只有一点点……不过，已经没事了。\n因为有可靠的伙伴们陪在我身边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1020_p", "source_sha256": "b1d4cb48f55c1ca7bd4770a43835bc641758f1e695d66f8690679887f81f99c9", "ja": "うん、そうだな。……さて、ステージの準備は整った。\nそろそろ時間だけど……。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。……好了，舞台已经准备就绪。\n差不多该到时间了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "acf858e85ecfbcfa55a8b4d5b8f57dafa71dc095ddb7532141ef792905e321d0", "ja": "よしっ！　今日は思いっきり盛り上げて……あっ！\nえっと、それだけじゃなくて。", "zh": "好！今天要尽情炒热气氛……啊！\n那个，不只是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "4a35f5897f9ac903846cafe151501b25380df3decbaba689bbe1c45775a0d1b7", "ja": "静かな曲も楽しんでもらえるように、\n心を込めて……だよねっ？", "zh": "为了让大家也能享受安静的歌曲，我会用心去唱……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "0f1334c4054b2aeb5906cfdbbcf4ab137730be1ff7cafa71881426cefd0a0f08", "ja": "ああ、そうだな！　静かな曲は静かに……\nけど楽しい曲は、思いっきり楽しくだ！", "zh": "啊，没错！安静的歌曲就要安静地……\n不过欢快的歌曲，就要尽情享受！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "af06a56817f9d85e619fa80c50df87f920e358496d85801ded8ab135c10a01a3", "ja": "うんっ、わかったよ{$P$}！\nそれじゃあみんな、せーの！", "zh": "嗯，明白了，{$P$}！\n那么大家，预备——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "5e6c34d6deac81a93e6a4bc4c01159e343249a9b49665c4350b63afde671cd7f", "ja": "行ってきます！", "zh": "我上场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1026_008tak", "source_sha256": "75133557f59df29494c0938969f36c0c309236de7ceb17ecf7e6c0ce9cb5da09", "ja": "行ってまいります。", "zh": "我出发了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1027_042miy", "source_sha256": "6536ec508f297156bd9cf718ee1413f35723477ec5c2d1d591ac738a35634b46", "ja": "行ってきます～。", "zh": "我出门啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "753dead84e59019c28dde63d3b6a380003f4105f72ada80cf164319d042569b1", "ja": "行ってきます、なのです！", "zh": "我出发啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_06_1029_p", "source_sha256": "c3899b143f252f49ad49d924835270028819677fbb34dbf18e656a2f8b0c4f55", "ja": "（4人は輝くような笑顔で、駆け出していく。今日は\n……いや、今日も、最高のステージになるだろう！）", "zh": "（4人带着灿烂的笑容跑了出去。今天……不，今天也一定会成为最棒的舞台吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
